 by $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ABC & =(AB)C \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-11 & 11 \\\\ -8 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359339 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359340 13194139535652 true] [17592186359339 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359341 13194139535652 true] [17592186359339 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535652 true] [17592186359339 1041 "field-1" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359339 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359340 13194139535652 true] [17592186359339 1110 #uuid "a362a355-9b78-59e9-92d2-5b9079a83718" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359340 1034 "-11" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359340 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359340 1111 #uuid "de607e2a-211a-52fe-ba2a-cf20880ffd04" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359341 1034 "11" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359341 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359341 1111 #uuid "f578abb2-5d28-59c8-97d1-9e040b6a545e" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359343 13194139535652 true] [17592186359342 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535652 true] [17592186359342 1041 "field-2" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359342 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359343 13194139535652 true] [17592186359342 1110 #uuid "05cf025c-7e54-5827-bbf5-a3d7629e557c" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359343 1034 "11" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359343 1111 #uuid "d9b8137b-d8a8-581c-9225-5d9a84d6db2e" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359344 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359345 13194139535652 true] [17592186359344 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535652 true] [17592186359344 1041 "field-3" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359344 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359345 13194139535652 true] [17592186359344 1110 #uuid "c0a26db9-dec6-517e-98b8-4ef077f1d24a" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359345 1034 "-8" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359345 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359345 1111 #uuid "b5d2839f-7f73-50c8-9eb3-636c341cc7f3" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359346 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359347 13194139535652 true] [17592186359346 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535652 true] [17592186359346 1041 "field-4" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359346 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359347 13194139535652 true] [17592186359346 1110 #uuid "48f647bc-be1d-512a-a5a2-2b4e839548cf" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359347 1034 "8" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359347 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359347 1111 #uuid "b9002334-a340-575c-b81a-80c6764767df" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1017 #edb/ref 17592186359349 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1017 #edb/ref 17592186359351 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1017 #edb/ref 17592186359353 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1089 "q-319943" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1100 "Calculate $ABC$, where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -1\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $ABC=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1113 #uuid "78c35ecd-2c3f-5a39-9862-6094c63c5273" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359348 1145 "First, recall the associative law\n\n$$\nABC=(AB)C=A(BC).\n$$\n\nNotice that $A$ is a $3\\times 1$ matrix, $B$ is a $1\\times 2$ matrix, and $C$ is a $2\\times 1$ matrix. Therefore, \n\n- multiplying $A$ by $B$, we will obtain a $3\\times 2$ matrix, which will require finding $6$ entries, while\n\n- multiplying $B$ by $C$, we will obtain a $1\\times 1$ matrix, which will require finding only $1$ entry.\n\nSo, we find the product $BC$ first: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BC & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-20-6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-26\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply $A$ by $BC:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ABC & =A(BC) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-26\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}78 \\\\ -52 \\\\ -182\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359349 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359350 13194139535652 true] [17592186359349 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535652 true] [17592186359349 1041 "field-1" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359349 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359350 13194139535652 true] [17592186359349 1110 #uuid "9bfde15d-c0d4-5bd5-ab89-6a3066399132" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359350 1034 "78" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359350 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359350 1111 #uuid "25dcc8cc-c670-5538-ae5a-f2183393a9ed" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359351 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359352 13194139535652 true] [17592186359351 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535652 true] [17592186359351 1041 "field-2" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359351 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359352 13194139535652 true] [17592186359351 1110 #uuid "4ea841dd-755f-539e-b9f4-c7f1030784c1" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359352 1034 "-52" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359352 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359352 1111 #uuid "67e27f0c-3baf-5ac2-bf27-0a97620611a1" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359353 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359354 13194139535652 true] [17592186359353 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535652 true] [17592186359353 1041 "field-3" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359353 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359354 13194139535652 true] [17592186359353 1110 #uuid "776e12a2-58df-5d71-86df-ce9117b18ca6" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359354 1034 "-182" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359354 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535652 true] [17592186359354 1111 #uuid "406612ae-4c02-519c-9e3a-0c3529b9c23e" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359355 1017 #edb/ref 17592186359356 13194139535652 true] [17592186359355 1089 "q-75717" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359355 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535652 true] [17592186359355 1100 "Given that $A,B,$ and $C$ are $6\\times 6$ matrices which of the following statements are always true? \n\n- $CB=BC$\n- $A(B-C)=AB-CA$\n- $A(BC)=(AB)C$" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359355 1113 #uuid "44d41d55-9292-54bc-9c95-2b343e22fdf1" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359355 1145 "Let's consider the statements one by one.\n\n- Statement I is false. Matrix multiplication is not commutative, so $AB\\ne BA$ in general.\n\n- Statement II is false. Matrix multiplication is distributive, so $A(B-C)=AB-AC,$ but $AC\\ne CA$ because matrix multiplication is not commutative in general.\n\n- Statement III is true. Matrix multiplication is associative and  $A(BC)=(AB)C$ is always true.\n\nTherefore, only statement  III is true." 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359357 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359358 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359359 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359360 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359361 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1041 "selection" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359359 13194139535652 true] [17592186359356 1110 #uuid "0eb977e5-f3bb-55d6-8615-6200132e8b34" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359357 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359357 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535652 true] [17592186359357 1111 #uuid "daa941ab-3a21-5f8f-a3f4-232076b745df" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359358 1034 "I only" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359358 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535652 true] [17592186359358 1111 #uuid "8dbb1b48-4a59-5e55-975c-c2f520ff229e" 13194139535652 true] [17592186359359 1034 "III only" 131941395356